{"suttaId":"tha-ap513","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3198,3218],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap513:0.3":"Kurañciyaphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap513:1.1":"“Migaluddo pure āsiṃ, vipine vicaraṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap513:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, sabbadhammāna pāraguṃ.","tha-ap513:2.1":"“Kurañciyaphalaṃ gayha, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap513:2.3":"Puññakkhettassa tādino, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap513:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap513:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap513:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap513:4.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap513:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, buddhaseṭṭhassa santike;","tha-ap513:5.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap513:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap513:6.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap513:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kurañciyaphaladāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap513:8.1":"Kurañciyaphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
